[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m Calculating the sum of the numbers from 1 to 8:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m \[
