[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m x = \frac{-8 - 4}{8} = \frac{-12}{8} = -\frac{3}{2}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m So, the solutions to the equation \( 4x^2 + 8x + 3 = 0 \) are \( x = -\frac{1}{2} \) and \( x = -\frac{3}{2} \).
