[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 1. **Identify the total number of possible outcomes when rolling two dice:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m    Each die has 6 faces, so the total number of possible outcomes when rolling two dice is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m    6 \times 6 = 36
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 2. **Identify the favorable outcomes where the difference between the numbers rolled is 0:**
