[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m Cross-multiplying to solve for $x$:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 8 \times 15 = 12 \times x
