[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m For a quadratic equation \(ax^2 + bx + c = 0\), the sum of the roots is given by \(-\frac{b}{a}\) and the product of the roots is given by \(\frac{c}{a}\).
