[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m - \(A\) is the amount of money accumulated after n years, including interest.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m - \(P\) is the principal amount (the initial amount of money).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m - \(r\) is the annual interest rate (decimal).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m - \(n\) is the number of times that interest is compounded per year.
