[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m - Starting population: 2 bacteria
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m - Population doubles every hour
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m For Sphere:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m - Starting population: 8 bacteria
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m - Population is quadrupled every hour
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m Let's denote the number of hours Jane has been growing Sphere since she started growing it as \( t \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
