[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m We can translate these statements into the following equations:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 1. \( H = L + 16 \)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 2. The average of the high and low temperatures is 3, so \( \frac{H + L}{2} = 3 \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
