[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m First, we factor the quadratic expression in the denominator:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m \[ x^2 + x - 6 = (x + 3)(x - 2). \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m So, the function can be rewritten as:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m \[ y = \frac{2}{(x + 3)(x - 2)}. \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
