[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m **Step 1: Expected value of a single roll of an eight-sided die.**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m The expected value \(E(X)\) of a single roll of an eight-sided die is the average of all possible outcomes. The possible outcomes are the numbers 1 through 8. Therefore, the expected value is calculated as follows:
