[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m \[ \text{Altitude} = \frac{a \cdot a}{a\sqrt{2}} = \frac{a^2}{a\sqrt{2}} = \frac{a}{\sqrt{2}} = \frac{a\sqrt{2}}{2} \]
