[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 1. \( 10 = 10 \times 1 \) which corresponds to \( p_1^9 \)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 2. \( 10 = 5 \times 2 \) which corresponds to \( p_1^4 p_2^1 \)
