[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m - The radius of the spherical tank (\(r_{sphere}\)) = 6 cm
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m Now, let's calculate the volumes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m \[V_{cylinder} = \pi (3)^2 (8) = 72\pi \, \text{cm}^3\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
