[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m The speed of the particle is the magnitude of this velocity vector:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m \[ \text{Speed} = \sqrt{\left( \frac{3}{4} \cos \frac{t}{4} \right)^2 + \left( -\frac{3}{4} \sin \frac{t}{4} \right)^2} = \sqrt{\frac{9}{16} \cos^2 \frac{t}{4} + \frac{9}{16} \sin^2 \frac{t}{4}} = \sqrt{\frac{9}{16} \left( \cos^2 \frac{t}{4} + \sin^2 \frac{t}{4} \right)} = \sqrt{\frac{9}{16} \cdot 1} = \frac{3}{4} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
