[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m This matches \(-\frac{b}{a} = -\frac{7}{4}\), which is consistent. Now, the product of the roots is:
