[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m we can rearrange it to:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m \[2a^2 + 4b^2 + c^2 - 4ab - 2ac = 0.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m We can try to complete the square for the terms involving \(a\) and \(b\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m \[2a^2 - 4ab + 4b^2 + c^2 - 2ac = 0,\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m \[(2a - 2b)^2 + (c - 2b)^2 = 0.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m Since the sum of two squares is zero, each square must be zero:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m \[2a - 2b = 0 \quad \text{and} \quad c - 2b = 0.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m This gives us:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m \[a = b \quad \text{and} \quad c = 2b.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=88572)[0m 
